---
Embedded end-user documentation; `dsp docs` lists topics

Usage: dsp docs [OPTIONS] [TOPIC]

Arguments:
  [TOPIC]  Topic to display. Omit to list all topics. Topics: dsp-cli, dsp, concepts, identifiers, connecting, output, workflows, errors, dsp-tools, sparql. Run `dsp docs` for one-line descriptions

Options:
      --pager       Page the output through $PAGER (default `less`)
  -v, --verbose...  Increase log verbosity (-v=info, -vv=debug, -vvv=trace). RUST_LOG overrides
  -j, --json        Emit the topic index as machine-readable JSON. Cannot be combined with a topic name or --pager
  -h, --help        Print help
